talk_text:
I could no longer live as a hero, nor could I die as one;
I just wandered the Netherworld...
How pathetic I felt...

I'm afraid I can't do that, Ms. Raspberyl.
I'm the head of the cheerleaders;
I must stay neutral.

That was when I embarked on this journey
for a way to bring her, the Overlord Asagi,
back to normal.

But Miss Flonne,
if we just stay inside,
we'll be done for once our food runs out...

Hmhmhm. I shared the Santa Power
from Mr. Christo to you, Sir Adell,
with my own powerup!

Oh, my friend! Then
let's start with Etna,
who laughed at me!

Oh, you're going to do it, too! Okay,
if that's what you want to do,
God, I'll give you a triple punch!

... but only while you work
for me. Outside of working hours,
I will not tolerate you.

Zaco has been put away. So much
for enjoying your freedom, Trenia. Enough,
back to the Book of Omniscience.

I will take Zenon and Pii-chan
from the other world here. Now,
please excuse me at ...

Just be careful, though—I’ve heard that
if you use it too much,
it can cause memory loss!
